    "detailed_description": "<strong>cursor0x0</strong> is a collection of various cursor mini games that require a good reaction, stamina, and precision. Fight enemies, win races, dodge bullets, complete different goals to unlock new challenge types and reach the final level! <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>30+ levels</strong> testing different mouse control skills: dodging, racing, stunts, drag and drop, etc. and <strong>bosses</strong> that require to demonstrate what you've learned to beat them. Every level features something special.<br></li><li> <strong>Three difficulty settings</strong>: from Rookie, suitable for new players, to almost unbeatable Expert one.<br></li><li> <strong>Local multiplayer for 2-4 players</strong> allowing to connect multiple mice and compete with friends.<br></li><li> More than a hundred of <strong>extra goals</strong>, making the levels harder. It will be a long journey to beat them all!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>cursor0x0</strong> is a collection of various cursor mini games that require a good reaction, stamina, and precision. Fight enemies, win races, dodge bullets, complete different goals to unlock new challenge types and reach the final level! <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>30+ levels</strong> testing different mouse control skills: dodging, racing, stunts, drag and drop, etc. and <strong>bosses</strong> that require to demonstrate what you've learned to beat them. Every level features something special.<br></li><li> <strong>Three difficulty settings</strong>: from Rookie, suitable for new players, to almost unbeatable Expert one.<br></li><li> <strong>Local multiplayer for 2-4 players</strong> allowing to connect multiple mice and compete with friends.<br></li><li> More than a hundred of <strong>extra goals</strong>, making the levels harder. It will be a long journey to beat them all!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Test your mouse skills in more than 30 various cursor mini games! Dodge bullets, collect stuff, fight the enemies, and take a risk to unlock all levels and complete the game. It shall not be an easy trip!",
